          "text": "military and employer courses reviewed by the American Council on Education (ACE)"
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "columbia-southern-catalog-2026-2028-transfer-sources-2026-11-26",
          "text": "CSU uses ACE guidelines to determine if training programs, certificates, professional licenses, and/or military training warrant awarding academic credit."
        },
        {
          "sourceId": "columbia-southern-catalog-2026-2028-transfer-sources-2026-11-26",
          "text": "will consider experiential learning credit through a Prior Learning Assessment (PLA) review."
